(ii) investigation is over and the charge-sheet is filed;
(iii)from the statement of the victim girl dated 07.04.2023, prima facie, this seems to be a case of relationship between the applicant NEUTRAL CITATION R/CR.MA/11081/2023 ORDER DATED: 19/08/2023 undefined and victim girl;
(iv) learned advocate Mr. Chintan Adeshara, upon instructions, states that there are no past antecedents reported against the present applicant;
6.

